    <key>NSAudioCaptureUsageDescription</key>
    <string>tx captures audio from selected meeting apps to create transcripts. Optional Gemini transcription sends audio to Google only when enabled.</string>
    <key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
    <string>tx records your microphone when dictating or when a meeting's microphone state is confirmed as unmuted.</string>
    <key>NSAppleEventsUsageDescription</key>
    <string>tx reads Meet tab titles and URLs in Arc or Chrome to identify meetings before recording browser audio.</string>
    <key>NSAccessibilityUsageDescription</key>
    <string>tx reads meeting window titles, checks call microphone controls, and pastes dictated text into the active app.</string>
    <key>NSInputMonitoringUsageDescription</key>
    <string>tx observes Fn and Esc globally to start and cancel voice dictation.</string>
    <key>NSSystemAdministrationUsageDescription</key>
    <string>tx uses Core Audio Taps to capture each app process. Tabs in one process share the same audio capture.</string>
